{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightcrawler</strong> is a minimalist retrowave arcade about the state of flow.<br>You get an endless road, a sunset, and synthwave. The game sets one clear rule: stay on track and pass through the gates. Miss one \u2014 the run is over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How it works</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clipping zones:</strong> align your path and pass through the gates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic difficulty:</strong> the longer you ride, the faster the road and the narrower the gaps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure focus:</strong> no distractions \u2014 just you, the motorcycle, and the rhythm of the road.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere:</strong> neon aesthetics and a synthwave soundtrack create a meditative yet intense flow.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game offers</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Endless road with meditative gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Atmospheric synthwave soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Neon, sunset, and retrofuturistic aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Simple controls \u2014 relax and enjoy the ride.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3931960?t=1757967939","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931960/01c6f8cdfb1994f4001e6b6ef493c203ae357ff0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757967939","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931960/14372d75982400bdc7044982993b20a9a5ce9b27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757967939","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3931960/14372d75982400bdc7044982993b20a9a5ce9b27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757967939","categories":[{"descriptio